From 97f175e2bb2ac512f82edc654b784721ec07eb90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:44:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD Vim visual selections for focused terminal panes

Start v, V, and Ctrl-V as active selections in the focused pane so navigation, yanking, folding, and status text share one selectable state instead of a separate visual cursor path.
